Package: vrm
Title: Visualization and Regression Modeling Utilities
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Christopher", "Weber", , "chrisweber@arizona.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A general-purpose toolkit for Bayesian and frequentist regression
    analysis workflows. Includes functions for model fitting (brms wrappers,
    ordered logit/probit), posterior prediction and marginal effects,
    counterfactual analysis (g-computation), propensity score weighting,
    exploratory data analysis, data recoding, and publication-ready visualization
    (sunflower plots, ridgeplots, forest plots, marginal effects panels).
